[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12542.79, "timestamp": "03:29:02", "text": "所以我问自己，难道你不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12545.99, "timestamp": "03:29:05", "text": "觉得你浪费了一年，一年，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12552.07, "timestamp": "03:29:12", "text": "一年，或者更久，对吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12555.19, "timestamp": "03:29:15", "text": "1年7个月，6个月，或者4个月，或者更久？而且，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12560.469, "timestamp": "03:29:20", "text": "回到家，我一直远离"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12563.99, "timestamp": "03:29:23", "text": "家乡，这真的很难熬，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12571.51, "timestamp": "03:29:31", "text": "坚持住。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12576.229, "timestamp": "03:29:36", "text": "直到今天，我仍然感觉自己不像是在日本。 即使我现在去参加祭典"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12578.95, "timestamp": "03:29:38", "text": "。 所以其中一半人是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12582.71, "timestamp": "03:29:42", "text": "日本人。 好多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12594.229, "timestamp": "03:29:54", "text": "还有牛排之类的东西。 很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12598.71, "timestamp": "03:29:58", "text": "食物、活动等等，"}]